Training data
-------------

The Simons model weights were trained on third-party datasets. Each dataset keeps its own license
and terms. The public datasets whose terms allow it are redistributed in the Hugging Face dataset
Simons-Pretrain (https://huggingface.co/datasets/abel-lab/Simons-Pretrain). Its NOTICE.md
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/abel-lab/Simons-Pretrain/blob/main/NOTICE.md) lists the
public datasets with their sources, licenses and attributions; the data were cleaned, resampled and
cut into training windows. The licenses of the following data require these notices:

