  Commission nor ECMWF is responsible for any use that may be made of the Copernicus information
  or data it contains.
- CAMS European air-quality forecasts: Contains modified Copernicus Atmosphere Monitoring Service
  information 2026. Neither the European Commission nor ECMWF is responsible for any use that may
  be made of the Copernicus information or data it contains.
- ECMWF IFS weather forecasts, retrieved through the Open-Meteo archive: Weather data by
  Open-Meteo.com (https://open-meteo.com/), CC BY 4.0. Based on data and products of the European
  Centre for Medium-Range Weather Forecasts (ECMWF, https://www.ecmwf.int/), CC BY 4.0.
- NASA POWER: Weather data were obtained from the NASA Langley Research Center POWER Project
  funded through the NASA Earth Science Directorate Applied Science Program.
- NCEP/CPC L3 Half Hourly 4km Global Merged IR (GPM_MERGIR): NASA is the source of these data
